	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy2_01w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちがうもーん！▼
おおあめ　ふらせて
カミナリを　おっことすのは▽
ほかの　ポケモンだもーん！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>違うもーん！▼
大雨　降らせて
カミナリを　落っことすのは▽
他の　ポケモンだもーん！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:38:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White
・主人公の背後から叫ぶ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T02:30:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>弟</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy2_01b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちがうもーん！▼
おおあめ　ふらせて
かぜを　びゅーびゅー　させるのは▽
ほかの　ポケモンだもーん！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
